# Module Registry

registry_purpose: catalog reusable modules and prevent duplicate bespoke implementation.

module_metadata_model:
  module_id: stable unique identifier
  version: semantic version string
  status: draft | approved | deprecated
  owner_agent: responsible agent role
  interfaces: exported contracts and dependencies
  compatibility: allowed blueprints and stacks
  quality_evidence: checks, tests, review record
  reuse_policy: mandatory | preferred | optional | forbidden

reuse_rules:
  - If a compatible approved module exists, prefer reuse over bespoke implementation.
  - New module creation requires explicit reason in the module plan.
  - Breaking changes require a new major version and compatibility review.
  - Deprecated modules must not be selected for new products.
